		  </li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-hKBt5SmFO26R">
		  </li></ul><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="iokvb">{{HEADLINE}}
		</div><ul id="i2i9t" class="fk-bullet"><li id="i68cd"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="iq25m" class="fk-bullet-list-container"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="ia7mz" class="fk-bullet-icon-container"><i id="irx9y" class="icp icp-auto far fa-calendar-alt">
				</i></div><div data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-jXb7MdPElCNp"><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="io9yv">{{MASTHEAD_TIMESTAMP}} - 
				  <i data-text="text" draggable="true" data-secondsdelay="">251.328 👁
				  </i></div></div></div></li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-KahhGPBLtkZk">
		  </li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-cBzeYdqBRxFp">
		  </li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-XfwLjj5Dbwfw">
		  </li></ul><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="itu8i"><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="i8yfg"><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i2h98">Written by {{BYLINE}} |&nbsp;
			  <div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-VHkTXHkfwVmi">
			  </div></div></div></div></div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="ixhjtwi"></div><img id="fkt-image-5e9-7b5-b5b" title="" target="_self" src="{{HERO_IMAGE_URL}}" href="" align="center" alt="" width="" height="" onclick="" class="fk-image-defaults"><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="ih8f78"><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-ASKCcEx7Klw3"><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><i data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Dear Friend With {{AUDIENCE_PAIN}},
			</i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">If you're reading this with your shoulder throbbing...
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">If you can't sleep on your side anymore...
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">If reaching for a cup in the cabinet feels like someone's stabbing you with a hot knife...
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Then what I'm about to share could save you from invasive procedures, endless physical therapy, and a lifetime of limitation.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">But I need to warn you:
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">What you're about to read will make you angry.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Because the method I discovered has been deliberately hidden from you.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Not because it doesn't work.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">But because it works TOO well.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">And when a $73 billion shoulder invasive procedures industry sees something that could make 87% of their procedures unnecessary...
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">They don't celebrate.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">They attack.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">My Name is {{DOCTOR_NAME}}.
			</b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I'm an orthopedic surgeon with 23 years of experience.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I've performed over 3,000 shoulder surgeries.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I've taught surgical techniques at Johns Hopkins.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">And until 18 months ago, I believed everything I'd been taught about rotator cuff degeneration.
		  </div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i5sihc"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-wmP1Dwz77Xz6"><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ietwg">{{SECTION_1_HEADER}}...
			</b></div></div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="itcqk86"><img id="fkt-image-8f3-da0-9f5" title="" target="_self" src="{{IMG_1_URL}}" href="" align="center" alt="" width="" height="" onclick="" class="fk-image-defaults disable-fk-lazy"></div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="ijc1c58" class="d-none"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="if6ohwg" class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9"><video allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" data-src="" aspectratio="embed-responsive-16by9" loop="" autoplay="" playsinline="" muted="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/a1aaf1a9a1194828a13de903798beb9d.mp4 " id="i8ivigl" class="fk-i4vh35o embed-responsive-item fk-disable-lazy">
			</video></div></div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="idakcwj">
		</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i2700n">Then at 3:17 AM on a Tuesday morning, everything changed.
		  <div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I woke up to a crash from our bathroom.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Racing in, I found my wife Sarah on the floor, sobbing.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">The bottle of Percocet had fallen from the top shelf.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">She couldn't reach it.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Her shoulder - the one that had been "manageable" for months - had finally given out.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">"I can't do it anymore," she whispered. "I can't even get my own painkillers."
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Sarah is a critical care nurse. Was a critical care nurse. For 19 years, she worked in the ICU - lifting, turning, and repositioning patients who couldn't move themselves. 
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">The wear on her shoulders was gradual, then sudden.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Now she couldn't lift her arm past 45 degrees.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">But Here's What Destroyed Me:
			  </b></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">When I tried to help her up, she screamed.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I touched her shoulder.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">That's all it took.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">We hadn't hugged - really hugged - in 4 months.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Every embrace ended in wincing.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Every attempted comfort became another reminder of what we'd lost.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">The woman who once lifted 200-pound patients couldn't hug her own husband.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">And I just stood there.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Useless.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">An orthopedic surgeon who couldn't even help his own wife.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I'd tried everything my training taught me. Physical therapy. Cortisone shots. Ice. Heat. TENS units.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Nothing worked for more than a few hours.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">The "experts" weren't any better:
			</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div></div></div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="ih6x2by"><ul id="ia15pqn" class="fk-bullet"><li id="ipguhgo"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="ivbapb8" class="fk-bullet-list-container bullet-list-container"><div data-secondsdelay="" class="fk-bullet-icon-container"><i id="iinl66d" class="icp icp-auto fas fa-circle">
				  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="isdenzf"><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Her physical therapist?
				  </b> Stretched and strengthened twice a week for $200 a pop. The relief lasted about as long as the car ride home.
				  <div data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div></div></div></div></li><li id="ie5fuq5"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="im561ak" class="fk-bullet-list-container bullet-list-container"><div data-secondsdelay="" class="fk-bullet-icon-container"><i id="ia69lfl" class="icp icp-auto fas fa-circle">
				  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="il8dax5"><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Pain management doctor? 
				  </b>Pumped her full of cortisone shots that made her gain 25 pounds and feel like a zombie.
				  <div draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div></div></div></div></li><li id="im3um4w"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="i5t40s9" class="fk-bullet-list-container bullet-list-container"><div data-secondsdelay="" class="fk-bullet-icon-container"><i id="ivemvnh" class="icp icp-auto fas fa-circle">
				  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="it6rayw"><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">The shoulder surgeon? 
				  </b>Wanted to slice her open for a $35,000 procedure with a 40% failure rate.
				  <div draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div></div></div></div></li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</li></ul></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="inmbvb9">That night, something inside me snapped.
		  <div data-secondsdelay="">
			<br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  </div>
			  <div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  </div>
			  <div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  </div>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I wasn't going to watch the woman I love turn into a prescription drug statistic.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I wasn't going to let some surgeon use her as a Mercedes payment.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I went to war with everything I thought I knew about shoulder pain.
			  </b>
			</div>
		  </div>
		</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ira3zeb"><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ifsffz"><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ixztl">{{SECTION_2_HEADER}}
			</b></div></div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="i6iuzyf"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="im9ylgj" class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9"><video allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" data-src="" aspectratio="embed-responsive-16by9" loop="" autoplay="" playsinline="" muted="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/79a13245cb204f65888a6cb1e3bac7ca.mp4" id="ir4elzu" class="fk-i4vh35o embed-responsive-item disable-fk-lazy">
			</video></div></div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="i2t9ehl">
		</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-Oh1MW2aFlH8e">For the next 3 months, I lived like a man possessed.
		  <div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I devoured every study. Called researchers in Japan who'd been studying microcirculation for decades. Flew to a conference in Sweden on regenerative therapy. Spent $28,000 of our savings on medical journals and insider reports.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">And what I found made me want to punch a hole through my computer screen.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">The entire shoulder invasive procedures industry is built on a lie.
			  </b></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">A $73 billion dollar lie that keeps you sick, desperate, and reaching for your wallet.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Here's what they don't want you to know:
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">87% of chronic rotator cuff pain has NOTHING to do with the tear itself.
			  </b></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">It's not about "strengthening the muscles." It's not about "improving range of motion." It's not about "reducing inflammation."
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">That's why none of the methods I tried ever worked.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">The REAL cause is something so simple, so obvious, that I kicked myself for missing it all these years.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Your shoulder tissue is literally suffocating.
			  </b></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Let me explain...
			</div></div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i1dnu3j">{{SECTION_3_HEADER}}
		</div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="ivek8a3"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="ivbhnc9" class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-1by1"><video allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" data-src="" aspectratio="embed-responsive-1by1" loop="" autoplay="" playsinline="" muted="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/6cf6e2e1b1ba4cd184a85f517e553c26.mp4" id="irxowjf" class="fk-i4vh35o embed-responsive-item disable-fk-lazy">
			</video></div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ivn1pm3"><i data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i52qe1">
		  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ipfuqnz"><i data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i1z3s1">
		  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i0lyhj">
		  <div data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-XBgBO9HKFwnq">
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3">Think of your shoulder like a door hinge.
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-2">
			  <br>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-3">When you're young, your shoulder moves like a brand-new hinge - smooth, silent, effortless.
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-4">
			  <br>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-5">That's because it's constantly bathed in nutrient-rich blood. Like a perfectly oiled hinge that glides without friction.
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-6">
			  <br>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-7">But here's what happens after age 40...
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-8">
			  <br>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-9">The blood supply starts drying up. The vessels disappear. The tissue starves.
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-10">
			  <br>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-11">Your shoulder starts moving like an old, rusty hinge that hasn't been oiled in years.
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-12">
			  <br>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qiKHQyWZ2Au3-13">You know the sound - that grinding, creaking protest every time it moves.
			</div>
		  </div>
		</div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="icbcy5m"><ul id="inffb6l" class="fk-bullet"><li id="i52yr42"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="i0a2p6l" class="fk-bullet-list-container bullet-list-container"><div data-secondsdelay="" class="fk-bullet-icon-container"><i id="iwyl86l" class="icp icp-auto fas fa-circle">
				  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="izziuxk"><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">By 50, 
				  </b>you've lost 50% of circulation. Your hinge is starting to creak.
				  <div draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div></div></div></div></li><li id="ie6nayj"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="itzoqyv" class="fk-bullet-list-container bullet-list-container"><div data-secondsdelay="" class="fk-bullet-icon-container"><i id="ivn7ras" class="icp icp-auto fas fa-circle">
				  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="iwb56zw"><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">By 60, 
				  </b>it's 70% gone. Now it's grinding, sticking, protesting with every movement.
				  <div draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div></div></div></div></li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</li></ul></div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="imzww3"><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="iywxt7j"><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="is3wg4d"><div data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">You feel it in the morning stiffness. The catching sensation when you reach overhead. The way your shoulder "talks to you" throughout the day.
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Your shoulder tissue is literally dying from lack of oxygen and nutrients.
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Like that rusty hinge slowly seizing up, metal grinding against metal, wearing itself down with every movement.
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">The medical industry KNOWS this.
				  </b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">They've known it since 1987 when Japanese researcher Dr. Hideki Matsumoto proved that 91% of failed shoulder surgeries had one thing in common: 
				  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">severely compromised blood flow.
				  </b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">But here's the kicker...
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">There's no money in addressing it.
				  </b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Why?
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Because the actual method is too simple. Too cheap. And it would put half the shoulder surgeons in Beverly Hills out of business.
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">You can't patent blood flow restoration.
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">You can't bill insurance for teaching someone how to finally get relief for their own shoulder.
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Think about it:
				  </b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">You wouldn't scrape the rust off a hinge and call it "fixed."
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">You'd oil it. Lubricate it. Restore what it needs to function.
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">But that's exactly what invasive procedures do - scrape away the "damage" (tears and bone spurs) while ignoring why it formed in the first place.
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">So they keep you on the hamster wheel.</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">It's genius, really.
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">If you're a sociopathic medical executive who sees human suffering as a revenue stream.
				</div></div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ikfy6ba">{{SECTION_4_HEADER}}
			</div><div data-secondsdelay="" id="i9h53o6" class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9"><video allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" data-src="" aspectratio="embed-responsive-16by9" loop="" autoplay="" playsinline="" muted="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/270aa1c713be41d4b8551e73b3e3ae73.mp4" id="il9jsjw" class="fk-i4vh35o embed-responsive-item disable-fk-lazy">
			  </video></div></div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-tGUN1ZootH6a">Remember my wife on that bathroom floor?
		  <div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Three weeks after my discovery, she was back at work. Full shifts in the ER.</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Truly life-changing.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Just 12 minutes a day of something so stupidly simple, I'm embarrassed it took me 23 years of career to figure it out.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">To relieve rotator cuff pain, you need to do THREE things simultaneously:
			  </b></div></div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i99fgx9">
		  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">1. HEAT
		  </b> - Open the blood vessels so circulation can reach starved tissue
		  <div data-secondsdelay="">
			<br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">2. COMPRESS
			  </b> - Force fresh blood and nutrients through the joint
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">3. VIBRATE
			  </b> - Stimulate cellular regeneration and muscle reset
			</div>
		  </div>
		</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i7dflus">Miss even ONE of these steps, and you're wasting your time.
		  <div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">That's why the usual methods don't work. (No circulation boost)
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">That's why massage doesn't work. (No deep tissue penetration)
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">That's why stretching doesn't work. (No cellular stimulation)
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">You need all three. At the same time. In the right sequence.
			  </b></div><div data-secondsdelay=""><b><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">A Triple Method Revival.
			</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">And that's exactly what I figured out how to do.
			</div></div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-J0TkJtWE0lu0">{{SECTION_5_HEADER}}
		</div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="ikrobdu"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="iy59m94" class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9"><video allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" data-src="" aspectratio="embed-responsive-16by9" loop="" autoplay="" playsinline="" muted="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/6bc9fe62abed4a20af4074ef32345cbe.mp4" id="ic97xxa" class="fk-i4vh35o embed-responsive-item disable-fk-lazy">
			</video></div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-Yev87gre1wCt">After Sarah's miracle recovery, word spread fast.
		  <div data-secondsdelay="">
			<br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  </div>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">My neighbor Marcus - construction foreman, 58 years old, tough as nails - knocked on my door at 9 PM.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">"Whatever you did for Sarah... I need it. NOW."
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">This man hadn't lifted his arm above his chest in 2 years. Rotator cuff pain had him popping Percocet like Tic Tacs just to swing a hammer.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">12 minutes on my prototype device.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">He cried.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Not from pain. From relief.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">"It's like someone just oiled my shoulder for the first time in years," he said.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Marcus told two guys on his crew. They told their wives. Word spread the way it does in a tight neighborhood - slowly at first, then all at once. Within two weeks, I had people I'd never met knocking on my door, asking about 'that shoulder thing.' I was doing demos in my garage on weekends, feeling like a fool. But it kept working.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Teachers who couldn't write on the whiteboard... Nurses who wanted to quit because lifting patients was torture... Dads who couldn't throw a ball with their kids...
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Every. Single. One. Got. Better.
			  </b>
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b>
				<br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  </b>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Not "managed their pain" better. Not "learned to live with it" better.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">ACTUALLY BETTER.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">That's when the threats started.
			</div>
		  </div>
		</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-MVjB74x9W8ru">{{SECTION_6_HEADER}}
		</div><img title="" target="_self" src="{{IMG_2_URL}}" href="" align="center" alt="" width="" height="" onclick="" id="fkt-image-dfd-da1-948" class="fk-image-defaults disable-fk-lazy"><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-tSh4Ox0XjtK7">First, it was "friendly" warnings.
		  <div data-secondsdelay="">
			<br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">A department head I'd known for years pulled me aside at a conference:
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">"Blane, what you're doing is dangerous. People need REAL medical treatment. You should stop before someone loses their job..."
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Then came the cease and desist letters.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Three law firms. All representing "concerned medical professionals" who claimed I was "undermining established treatment protocols."
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">The final straw?
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">My biggest equipment supplier - a company I'd bought from for 15 years - suddenly couldn't fulfill my orders.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">"Sorry Blane, corporate decision. Nothing personal."
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b>
				<br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  </b>
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">They wanted me gone because I'd created something that could make their entire business model obsolete.
			  </b>
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">A device that:
			</div>
		  </div>
		</div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="iru1sew"><ul id="i25co5m" class="fk-bullet"><li id="iznddjl"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="iy0vtt8" class="fk-bullet-list-container bullet-list-container"><div data-secondsdelay="" class="fk-bullet-icon-container"><i id="imi45gq" class="icp icp-auto fas fa-circle">
				  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="iqlkjvp">Solved the ROOT CAUSE of shoulder pain (not just symptoms)
				</div></div></li><li id="izicd8g"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="iftxdki" class="fk-bullet-list-container bullet-list-container"><div data-secondsdelay="" class="fk-bullet-icon-container"><i id="idvq5rl" class="icp icp-auto fas fa-circle">
				  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ii3r4uv">Worked in 12 minutes a day (not weeks of appointments)
				  <div draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div></div></div></div></li><li id="ixerygs"></li><li id="ivbhehn"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="iuamajf" class="fk-bullet-list-container bullet-list-container"><div data-secondsdelay="" class="fk-bullet-icon-container"><i id="iwdruml" class="icp icp-auto fas fa-circle">
				  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
				</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="iurma5d">Let people manage it themselves at home (not in some $3 million surgical suite)
				  <div draggable="true" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div><div data-text="text" draggable="true" data-secondsdelay="">
					</div></div></div></div></li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</li><li data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</li></ul></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i45ftvo">
		  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">But here's what those suits didn't count on...
		  </b>
		  <div data-secondsdelay="">
			<br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">I'd already partnered with a team of biomedical engineers who believed in the mission.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">And we'd turned my garage prototype into something even better.
			</div>
		  </div>
		</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="itksswy"><b data-highlightable="1" data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="il192l"><span data-highlightable="1" id="ibsf2f8" class="cc-rte-styled"><span data-highlightable="1" id="iuqvx5k" class="cc-rte-styled">{{SECTION_7_HEADER}}<br data-text="text" draggable="true" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="izf7wy"></span></span></b><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="i7hc4k"><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="i3fnz6"><b data-text="text" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="i0z4ad">
			  </b></div><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="iwl8us"><b data-text="text" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="iez6rg">
			  </b></div><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="ixuul7"><b data-text="text" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="i3jyqp">
			  </b></div></div></div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="i524twj"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="isyommj" class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9"><video allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" data-src="" aspectratio="embed-responsive-16by9" loop="" autoplay="" playsinline="" muted="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/3240f781ac0d42c795942fd9aecabb23.mp4" id="iyonet6" class="fk-i4vh35o embed-responsive-item disable-fk-lazy">
			</video></div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ikqqjsh"><b data-highlightable="1" data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-MKPkiya405GP"><span data-highlightable="1" id="icr51yk" class="cc-rte-styled"></span></b><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-dhTXIPUiGoGl"><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-eqC5lETyyrWd"><b data-text="text" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-qBWsT1bGocio">
			  </b></div><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-4AB0yg0QyKBq"><b data-text="text" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-mXaddiXG8Fok">
			  </b></div><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-SgG4ae0OfSiV"><b data-text="text" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-9FGp0WADlSJF">
			  </b></div></div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ihljs5">It's called the 
		  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">{{PRODUCT_NAME}}.
		  </b>
		  <div data-secondsdelay="">
			<b>
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</b>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">And it's THE single device on earth that delivers all three requirements for lasting rotator cuff relief:
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b>
				<br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  </b>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">✓ PRECISION HEAT
			  </b> at exactly 42°C that penetrates 3 inches deep into the joint
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b>
				<br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  </b>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">✓ RHYTHMIC COMPRESSION
			  </b> at 3-5 PSI that forces fresh blood through starved tissue
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b>
				<br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  </b>
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">✓ TARGETED VIBRATION
			  </b> at 60Hz that stimulates cellular regeneration
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">All three. Synchronized. Automatic.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">You literally just strap it on, press one button, and let 18 months of obsessive research — backed by 23 years of hands-on surgical experience — do the work.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">No appointments. No copays. No nonsense.
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Just your shoulder finally getting what it's been screaming for:
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">BLOOD. NUTRIENTS. RELIEF.
			  </b>
			</div>
			<div data-secondsdelay="">
			  <br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			</div>
			<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Think of it as WD-40 for your rusty shoulder hinge - except it works from the inside out.
			</div>
		  </div>
		</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i8ff2tf">
		</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="iyor6k1"><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" class="rte-styled-text">
		  </div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-CD80XZ3eXphA"><b data-highlightable="1" data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-KzUCmnyJhJoH" data-layer-name="Text" class="rte-styled-text"><span data-highlightable="1" id="cc-id-41fu4UgcbTf4" class="cc-rte-styled gjs-selected rte-styled-text"><span id="cc-id-FXiygOsSPFH8" class="cc-rte-styled rte-styled-text">{{SECTION_8_HEADER}}</span></span></b><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-x3iviNstN5ov" data-layer-name="Box" class="rte-styled-text"><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-nIuBUTp7aqaX" data-layer-name="Box" class="rte-styled-text"><b data-text="text" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-eWxnh8PW0ceu" data-layer-name="Text" class="rte-styled-text">
			  </b></div><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-4N6TbV2O3iOI" data-layer-name="Box" class="rte-styled-text"><b data-text="text" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-4tDPDZVUQvTt" data-layer-name="Text" class="rte-styled-text">
			  </b></div><div data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-TgcbQfG7l4VB" data-layer-name="Box" class="rte-styled-text"><b data-text="text" data-highlightable="1" data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-gIjuSltYvFtC" data-layer-name="Text" class="rte-styled-text">
			  </b></div></div></div><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="iaegt06"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="iuoimni" class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9"><video allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" data-src="" aspectratio="embed-responsive-16by9" loop="" autoplay="" playsinline="" muted="" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/d46dcc491c5d47a4a35841cd05c49023.mp4" id="inhc40w" class="fk-i4vh35o embed-responsive-item disable-fk-lazy">
			</video></div></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i955kux"><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">When you strap on the RejuvaCare, here's what happens:
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<br>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">0-4 Minutes: The Opening Phase
			</b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<b>
			  <br>
			</b>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">The device delivers precision heat at exactly 42°C - the temperature proven to dilate blood vessels without causing inflammation. Your shoulder starts warming from the inside out.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<br>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Most people feel a spreading warmth in the first 30 seconds. That's years of constriction finally releasing.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<br>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">4-8 Minutes: The Flooding Phase
			</b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<b>
			  <br>
			</b>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Rhythmic compression at 3-5 PSI creates a pumping action that forces fresh, oxygenated blood through tissue that's been starving for years. This triggers what researchers call "forced perfusion" - basically CPR for your rotator cuff.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<br>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Think of it like finally oiling that seized-up hinge. Bringing it back to life.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<br>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">8-12 Minutes: The Reset Phase
			</b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<br>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Targeted vibration at 60Hz works through your shoulder muscles, releasing years of protective tension and stimulating cellular regeneration at the deepest level.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<br>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">This is the step EVERYONE else misses. And why their pain always comes back.
