			<b>
			  <br>
			</b>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">You move your arm feeling like someone just gave you a new shoulder.
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
			<br>
		  </div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Not "better for a few hours" like after a massage. Not just masked or numbed.</div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">
