			  <i data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ivnvoo">"I was scheduled for an invasive procedure. Deposit paid. Used {{DOCTOR_LAST_NAME}}'s device as a last resort. Five months later, I'm working 10-hour shifts as a dental hygienist. Pain-free. My surgeon called to ask why I didn't reschedule. I told him I didn't need to anymore. He hung up on me."
