			  </b><i data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">"Couldn't lift my arm past my chest. Workers comp wanted permanent disability. 3 weeks with the RejuvaCare, I'm framing houses again. My doctor said it's 'impossible.' I said, 'Watch me swing this hammer.'"
			  </i></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" data-layer-name="LineBreak" class="rte-styled-text">
