			  </b><i data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i5lwhv">"I'm 54. ER nurse for 17 years - just like {{DOCTOR_LAST_NAME}}'s wife. Lifting patients destroyed both shoulders. They wanted a bilateral procedure. Been using RejuvaCare for 3 months. Just got promoted to charge nurse. The young nurses ask how I move so easily. I just smile."
