				</b>"I'm a PM&amp;R specialist. I see failed shoulder surgeries every week. When I reviewed {{DOCTOR_LAST_NAME}}'s research, the mechanism made immediate sense. I tried it on my own chronic shoulder issue first. Then I started quietly recommending it to patients who wanted to avoid invasive procedures. The results have been remarkable."
